dispatch (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Mail mode: IMAP/SMTP with STARTTLS, local Maildir, compose, threads,
    and an Ephemeris address picker. Feed mode unchanged.

 -- Greg Gauthier <gmgauthier@protonmail.com>  Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:30:00 +0100

