dispatch (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. gtkmm-3 Outlook Express-shaped feed reader for LCOS
    (milestones M0–M6): stacked panes, RSS/Atom, OPML, HTML subset,
    in-feed images and Play for audio/video, Appearance, persist layout,
    auto-refresh.

 -- Greg Gauthier <gmgauthier@protonmail.com>  Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:00:00 +0100
